  "weaponAnchorNote": "The node named weaponAnchor carries this as its rest transform AND a translation + rotation track on every clip, keyed against that clip's weights. UE1 draws a carried item at the pawn's weapon triangle with the triangle's own orientation, and the triangle is per-frame data, so the hand swings with the arm.",
